"1. 知识受限于训练数据"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.149, 0.693, 0.369, 0.845], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.149, 0.693, 0.369, 0.845], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.152, 0.853, 0.364, 0.888], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. 知识受限于训练数据无法获取训练时点之后的信息。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.39, 0.669, 0.61, 0.687], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. 无法直接与外部系统交互"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.387, 0.667, 0.616, 0.845], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.387, 0.667, 0.616, 0.845], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.392, 0.853, 0.612, 0.9], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. 无法直接与外部系统交互无法查询实时数据、调用API或读取数据库。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.634, 0.667, 0.859, 0.84], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.634, 0.667, 0.859, 0.84], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.641, 0.853, 0.851, 0.901], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3. 不具备状态保持能力难以进行连贯的多轮对话，遗忘之前的上下文。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.122, 0.916, 0.865, 0.951], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "所以要构建真正实用的AI应用，必须将大语言模型与外部工具、数据源和记忆机制有机结合，从而催生了LangChain框架的设计理念。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.122, 0.036, 0.518, 0.052], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain，是当前构建生产级 AI 智能体系统的"}, {"type": "text", "content": "首选", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.123, 0.066, 0.425, 0.088], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1.3 LangChain框架的定位"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.125, 0.097, 0.874, 0.388], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.125, 0.097, 0.874, 0.388], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.145, 0.398, 0.846, 0.434], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "LangChain 作为大模型与应用间的中间层，可统一调用各类大模型、管理提示词与上下文，还能集成外部工具和数据源，快速搭建具备推理、行动能力的智能体。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.146, 0.442, 0.26, 0.459], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "核心定位三点:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.166, 0.47, 0.748, 0.487], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "打通大模型与外部资源", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": ":统一接口对接数据库、检索引擎、API、文件系统等；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.166, 0.489, 0.707, 0.504], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "封装底层复杂逻辑", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": ":抽象工具调用、记忆等能力，降低智能体开发难度；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.166, 0.506, 0.859, 0.54], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "支撑多智能体协作", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": ":依托 LangGraph 等生态，从单智能体拓展至多智能体协作，可构建工业级智能体。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.124, 0.554, 0.424, 0.576], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1.4 LangChain的应用场景"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.125, 0.587, 0.874, 0.876], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.125, 0.587, 0.874, 0.876], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.123, 0.887, 0.296, 0.903], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. 检索增强生成 (RAG)"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.139, 0.913, 0.573, 0.929], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "痛点:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 解决大模型知识滞后（无实时数据）和幻觉问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.139, 0.931, 0.807, 0.948], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "功能:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 检索外部知识库（文档/数据库）并向量化，让模型基于最新、最相关的资料回答。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 2, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.123, 0.036, 0.283, 0.052], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. Agent 智能体构建"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.139, 0.063, 0.514, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "痛点:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 解决 LLM 无法直接执行复杂任务的问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.139, 0.08, 0.863, 0.114], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "功能:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 将模型作为“推理引擎”，自主规划路径并动态调用外部工具（如订票、查报告、写 SQL），实现复杂任务。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.123, 0.126, 0.312, 0.142], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3. 对话系统与聊天机器人"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.14, 0.153, 0.468, 0.168], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "痛点:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 解决多轮对话中的“记忆”流失问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.14, 0.17, 0.877, 0.204], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "功能:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 集成记忆管理系统，记住用户偏好和历史交互，并结合私有数据（如教育教材、订单库）提供专业服务。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.123, 0.216, 0.264, 0.231], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4. 多模态应用开发"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.14, 0.242, 0.408, 0.258], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "痛点:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 跨越单一文本交互的限制。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.139, 0.26, 0.817, 0.277], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "功能:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 融合图像识别、语音转文字等技术，让模型具备处理音视频和图片的综合推理能力。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.123, 0.287, 0.329, 0.303], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5. 自动化写作与格式化生成"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.139, 0.315, 0.555, 0.33], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "痛点:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 解决生成内容格式不标准、质量不稳定的问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.14, 0.333, 0.866, 0.366], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "功能:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 配合提示词模板（Templates）与输出解析器（Parsers），自动产出规范的报告、合同或邮件。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.123, 0.377, 0.312, 0.392], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "6. 数据连接与结构化处理"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.139, 0.405, 0.554, 0.42], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "痛点:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 解决非结构化数据难以被模型直接利用的问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.139, 0.422, 0.868, 0.457], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "功能:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 强大的数据连接能力使大模型能够与各种数据源和结构化数据交互。比如，从 PDF、Excel中提取关键信息，或实现自然语言与 SQL 的自动转换。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.124, 0.47, 0.392, 0.492], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1.5 大模型相关岗位介绍"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.125, 0.502, 0.875, 0.76], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.125, 0.502, 0.875, 0.76], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.123, 0.771, 0.481, 0.788], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "应用开发是大模型最值得关注的方向:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "应用为王！", "styles": ["bold"]}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.31, 0.833, 0.676, 0.891], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "8langchain"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.364, 0.909, 0.624, 0.926], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The agent engineering platform."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.33, 0.932, 0.658, 0.946], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "license downloads 1.8G v1.2.15 Follow @LangChain"}]}]}], "is_full_document": false, "schema": "docvortex.middle", "schema_version": "2.0"}